## 7. Quotes and data points a strategist can use verbatim

1. **On the shape of the label.** London City Airport's own policy page: **"Announcements in the terminal will only be made in the event of an emergency or during periods of bad weather."** [Source: https://www.londoncityairport.com/at-the-airport/need-to-know/airport-policies/silent-policy]
2. **On the compensating channel.** Schiphol's accessibility guidance: **"All important information about your flight, such as gate changes, delays and cancellations, are shown on flight information screens, on this website and in the Schiphol app."** [Source: https://www.schiphol.nl/en/assistance/flying-for-the-deaf-and-blind/]
3. **On the code ceiling.** NFPA 72 (per practitioner reference): **"at least 90 percent of the measurement locations within each acoustically distinguishable space have a measured STI of not less than 0.45 and an average STI of not less than 0.50."** [Source: https://www.suppressionsystems.com/voice-intelligibility-in-mass-notification-systems/]
4. **On the digital-exclusion risk.** Reported passenger comment on a US silent-terminal experience: **"If someone decides to go shopping at the last minute and doesn't have an app installed, they might miss their flight."** [Source: https://simpleflying.com/airport-quiet-policy-frustrating-passengers-sfo/]
5. **On why the muted TV is no longer a technology problem.** CNN, on shuttering its 30-year Airport Network in March 2021: travelers were "more likely to stare at their phones than look up to watch a tiny screen above their heads." [Source: https://www.seattletimes.com/business/cnn-shutting-down-its-airport-network-after-nearly-30-years/]
6. **On the platform scale that is now buildable.** Bosch on the Munich Terminal 1 PA/VA replacement: **"up to 3,000 Praesensa system components and 10,000 audio zones to be managed centrally"** — connected to ~14,000 existing loudspeakers. [Source: https://www.boschbuildingtechnologies.com/xc/en/stories/munich-airport-relies-on-a-networked-public-address-and-voice-alarm-solution/]

