## 8. Named evidence gaps (do not fill by inference)

- Independent before/after measurement of ambient level, RT60, or STI at any of the named "silent" peers.
- Audited missed-boarding or gate-hold data attributable to silent-terminal policies.
- Any published cost or ROI figure for a quiet-by-design specification that is not vendor-authored.
- Current MWAA Design Manual sections on acoustics, PA zoning, EVACS, FIDS, and tenant technology (not retrieved in this pass).
- Current TSA guidance on required-announcement frequency, wording, and multilingual coverage in the US (not retrieved in this pass).
